								<div id="contentForThisGame_ctn">
				</div>
									<div data-panel="{&quot;type&quot;:&quot;PanelGroup&quot;}" id="aboutThisGame" class="game_page_autocollapse" style="max-height: 850px;">
						<div id="game_area_description" class="game_area_description">
							<h2>About This Game</h2>
							<p class="bb_paragraph" >Moving into her own home was supposed to mark the start of a peaceful, happy life. Agatha, a young woman, finally finds her own cozy sanctuary: quiet surroundings, fresh air, charming wooden window frames, and peaceful neighbors. On her very first day, an elderly neighbor named Lidia Petrovna welcomes the newcomer warmly and offers her homemade pastries. Nothing hints at the trouble to come.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >But soon, the idyll begins to unravel.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >At night, strange rustling sounds and footsteps echo through the empty rooms; children's footprints appear on the walls, and a light burns constantly in the window across the way. Day by day, Agatha notices terrifying changes: her body grows heavy, her strength drains away, wrinkles appear on her face, and her memories become suspiciously muddled. Meanwhile, the mysterious neighbor seems to grow younger before her very eyes.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >An old diary belonging to the previous resident—discovered by chance in the attic—along with a mysterious photograph, reveals a chilling truth: this house is no ordinary home. It is a trap that feeds on the youth, time, and pain of others, dragging its victims into an endless, grim cycle.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" ></p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Game Features:</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Interactive story with choices: Your decisions, dialogue, and actions shape Agatha’s fate and lead to one of multiple endings.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Psychological horror and paranoia: A deep dive into an oppressive atmosphere of isolation, the fear of withering away, and the loss of control over one’s own body.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Atmospheric soundtrack: Unsettling melodies and ambient sounds heighten the sense of dread, tension, and total immersion in the nightmare.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Deep personal drama: A story about repressed memories, guilt, family trauma, and the struggle against an inescapable past.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" > </p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Adult Content Description</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >This game may contain material unsuitable for all ages, as well as themes that cause intense psychological distress:</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Psychological horror and paranoia: An oppressive atmosphere of isolation, loss of control over one's own body, escalating madness, and fear of the unknown.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Body horror elements: Accelerated and unnatural aging (wrinkles, graying hair, skin changes, and physical wasting), physical weakness, and illness (nausea, vomiting).</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Heavy emotional themes: Coping with the loss of a loved one (death of a mother), guilt, repressed traumatic memories, and psychological pressure.</p><p class="bb_paragraph" >Isolation and captivity: Confinement in an enclosed space, helplessness in the face of a supernatural threat, and a sense of hopelessness.</p>						</div>
					</div>
					<div class="game_page_autocollapse">
		<div id="game_area_content_descriptors" class="game_area_description">
