			<h2>Mature Content Description</h2>
			<p>The developers describe the content like this:</p>
			<p><i>
			This game is intended for mature players (18+) only. We recommend choosing with caution.<br />
<br />
The game contains scenes of smoking, weapons, and alcohol. It also features scenes of murder and dismemberment. It also features extremely violent scenes of murder. <br />
Because the game is set in a harsh, ruthless criminal underworld, players will encounter scenes of explicit violence. This includes blood, the use of weapons, murder, and physical interrogations. The plot also depicts alcohol consumption, the use of medical sedatives, and encounters with characters struggling with drug addiction.<br />
<br />
All characters involved in adult scenes are over 21 years of age and are fictitious.				</i>
			</p>
